  Inlined rather than an <img> so it inherits `currentColor`, which lets the
  footer's own text-color setting drive it instead of it being locked to the
  brand blue. Size it from the caller via CSS on a wrapping element;
  `width/height: 100%` on the svg overrides its own width/height attributes.
